## Validating

```bash
quilltap themes validate ./{{THEME_ID}}
```

The validator is the app's own: it reports what an install would refuse, and warns about CSS that targets something other than a hook, with the file and line.

## Installing

```bash
# Pack the directory as a .qtap-theme
cd {{THEME_ID}} && zip -r ../{{THEME_ID}}.qtap-theme . && cd ..

# Install it from the command line ...
quilltap themes install {{THEME_ID}}.qtap-theme
```

... or upload the `.qtap-theme` file in Settings → Appearance → Install Theme.
